docs {
  # Get Daily Expense Breakdown (`GetDailyExpenseBreakdown`)
  
  **Handler**: `handlers.GetDailyExpenseBreakdown` in [dashboard_handler.go](file:///d:/Codes/budget-tracker/go-server/handlers/dashboard_handler.go)
  **Route**: `GET /api/_private/v1/dashboard/:userId/expenses` (Private - Bearer Token required)
  
  ### Description
  Returns an itemized timeline of expenditures grouped by calendar date (`YYYY-MM-DD`):
  - Gathers all personal expenditures (`type = 'PERSONAL'`) and marks them with tag `"PERSONAL"`.
  - Gathers all expense splits assigned to this user:
    - If paid by another person, tagged as `"BORROWED"` and includes the `paidBy` object (`id`, `username`).
    - If paid by this user, tagged as `"MY_SHARES"`.
    
  ### URL Parameters
  - `userId` (string, path parameter): User ID (defaults to `{{userId}}`).
  
  ### Expected Response Structure
  ```json
  {
    "expenseBreakdown": {
      "2026-09-29": [
        {
          "id": "expense_123",
          "amount": "24.50",
          "description": "Lunch at cafe",
          "type": "SPLIT",
          "tag": "BORROWED",
          "paidBy": {
            "id": "user_456",
            "username": "alex"
          },
          "createdAt": "2026-09-29T13:45:00Z"
        }
      ]
    }
  }
  ```
}
